{"title":"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all pairs of distinct real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> such that both of the following are true:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10df4ca3b822bddba4a7b3efe1846aa39694c338.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x^{100} - y^{100} &amp;= 2^{99} (x-y) \\\\ x^{200} - y^{200} &amp;= 2^{199} (x-y) \\end{align*}\" width=\"192\" height=\"47\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5a6eec91eee89060b2954a23ef5781e099dcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2a$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/b/88b966a5ac7fd3876880d3699e18f4cee1525768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" /> resulting in the below system.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/84235ba05c281724c41517ae155845f7f14a403d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a^{100} - b^{100} &amp;= a-b \\\\ a^{200} - b^{200} &amp;= a-b \\end{align*}\" width=\"144\" height=\"43\" />\nSubstitution and factoring of difference of squares results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cc76ee8826b36dfee7b848b1fc11054fe71d01.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a^{100} - b^{100} &amp;= a^{200} - b^{200} \\\\ a^{100} - b^{100} &amp;= (a^{100} - b^{100})(a^{100} + b^{100}) \\\\ 0 &amp;= (a^{100} - b^{100})(a^{100} + b^{100} - 1) \\end{align*}\" width=\"324\" height=\"75\" />\nBy the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Zero_Product_Property\" title=\"Zero Product Property\">Zero Product Property</a>, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/3/703f5c6d14430e7c600b576f18b873114fb7309f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{100} = b^{100}$\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de5b8abc0819fb579da54e0c3a292500d6c70e52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{100} + b^{100} = 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"16\" />  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/3/703f5c6d14430e7c600b576f18b873114fb7309f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{100} = b^{100}$\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/6/426ee5e69c835d409ad4f22e2ed3cb451ef99104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ne b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc899c0386206b22cfdaa5a56b74fda5484407a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -b.$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />  However, a quick check reveals this to be an extraneous solution.\n</p><p><br />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de5b8abc0819fb579da54e0c3a292500d6c70e52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{100} + b^{100} = 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"16\" />  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/4/77460b6c29b67b7514da6720264df8962da06c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d738b945acb8208933545e7157db46724bedc415.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" /> and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da6fbfb08dae9474b8cf9d4fec3345e0eb81452c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7eced2a55115a8baf95fe12ec3289a46c0e1cda6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />  Now assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d605070f8fe0bfb2e6b5bbf56effd7f04a26b667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a|, |b| &lt; 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/a/d5ae673b8cc8cb44891458bbc8d7751f319c2644.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{100} - a = b^{100} - b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5ccc388363b42884a252ba09ecaaee21939faf10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{b^{99} - 1}{a^{99} - 1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"39\" />  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/7/957db7e39fbf5df9969ba897a4c9b1cacd582c1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b^{99} - 1}{a^{99} - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"39\" /> is positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must have the same sign.\n</p><p><br />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/a/e6aad4ba8506755416002d5d3877c2bdfc09c2f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{100} - b^{100}}{a-b} = 1 = \\sum_{i=0}^{99} a^i b^{99-i}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"227\" height=\"50\" />  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> are negative, then the sum is negative since each term is negative, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> must both be positive.  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27c3a5ac2d82fd06e277c2ebd2ad23394cca4a5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{99} + b^{99} &lt; 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" /> so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c995245064a2cfe819c8bca46f6d4821f273b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a^{99} + b^{99} &amp;&lt; a^{100} + b^{100} \\\\ a^{99} + b^{99} &amp;&lt; a \\cdot a^{99} + b \\cdot b^{99}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"206\" height=\"44\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578c11f130e8b55adadb008d46232e4c4da00ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b &lt; 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/d/b2d577710358a61d65d29d352196e79916d685b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{99} + b^{99} &lt; a^{99} + b^{99}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"163\" height=\"16\" />  However, that can not happen, so there are no more solutions.\n</p><p><br />\nThis means that the only solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2ad20e719a53cbd6037473dcff0ecab28a8355f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(0,2),(2,0)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"103\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO\">2017 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017233002\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 189/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5838/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.899      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    6.899      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16656:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017233002 and revision id 97247. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}